	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"劇場映画「機動戦士ガンダム　逆襲のシャア」に登場する主役モビルスーツ「ニューガンダム」が遂にマスターグレードで登場。",
			"劇中のイメージそのままに、各関節が可動し、様々なポーズを取らせることが出来ます。",
			"また、内部メカフレームも完全再現し、ダイキャストパーツを使用するなど，ディテールも徹底追及しています。",
			"もちろん、各種武器も付属し，最大の特徴のフィンファンネルも分離・可動します。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The main mobile suit \"New Gundam\" that appears in the movie \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack\" is finally available in master grade.",
			"Each joint is movable and can be posed in a variety of ways, just as it appears in the movie.",
			"In addition, the internal mechanical frame is completely reproduced, and the details are thoroughly pursued, such as using die-cast parts.",
			"Of course, various weapons are also included, and the most distinctive feature, the fin funnel, can be separated and moved."
		]
	},
